{"v":1,"type":"session-summary","author_email":"contact@atkn.me","session":"kandev:83a0b430-49c1-4819-89d0-81c76deb6fd8","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:45:00Z","entries":[{"driving_event":"The signature, trust and authority protocol surfaces had landed, but users still could not operate them safely through the CLI: checkpoints could be stamped with explicit null authority, separate notes and envelope sync routes could disagree about quarantine, and trust-store setup/removal could strand or overwrite local trust decisions.","decision":"Expose trust, sign, verify, role, policy and authority-aware ledger commands; resolve authority by default while preserving an explicit null override; fail closed for invalid authority and quarantined materialization; add a trust-store lifecycle that never deletes existing stores and uses atomic no-replace creation; and report only the authority actually stamped. Keep the signature payload frozen and treat its own record metadata as informational, not cryptographically attested.","impact":"Operators can create and manage local ed25519 trust, reach trusted and policy-satisfying states, inspect signature and authority status, and use signing and ledger controls without putting private keys in the worktree or deleting adopted/shared trust files. Quarantined evidence cannot enter canonical notes through either CLI sync or explicit materialize. Invalid authority states do not fetch, build or promote. Ledger build remains an intentional append operation.","recurrence_control":"Independent Muse review accepted the signing, policy, authority and quarantine behavior; Mainline Worker accepted trust-store preservation and race handling. The exact staged tree passed typecheck and 586/586 tests, including real Git fixtures for failed-key rollback, trust-store preservation, exclusive creation, authority refusal, mirror/import-only envelope guards, policy exits, key rotation and explicit stamped-authority reporting. `git diff --cached --check` and Reveries `check --staged` passed before commit.","alternatives":["Leave trust and authority as hand-edited local configuration, requiring operators to coordinate CLI behavior manually.","Put trust material in tracked evidence so clones share it, exposing local trust decisions to transport and risking private-key material entering Git."],"sources":[],"reveries":[],"retirements":[]}]}
